      "writtenOn": "2023-12-07T08:33:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Got it. Thank you for letting me know about other hypervisors as well.\n\nChanged to continue booting when hypervisor is missing.\n\n\nFollow up questions)\n\n\u003e So, review comment: don\u0027t take the hypervisor by Option in `DeviceAssignmentInfo::parse`.\n\nWhat if a node in VM DTBO doesn\u0027t require physical `\u003creg\u003e` and `\u003ciommus\u003e` but assigned as if it\u0027s a device driver node? I assume that it can be allowed even when device assigning hypervisor doesn\u0027t exist.\n\nAlso, I need a way to inject `MockHypevisor` for testing -- that\u0027s why take hypervisor as platform",
      "parentUuid": "b49eec15_e83ce022",
      "revId": "65707aa24bc641d18b8c75fe11e309b810339430",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
